# Local-only seed config overrides (e.g. config/app-config.local.yaml,
# config/slack-bot-config.local.yaml). The committed *.yaml files in
# config/ stay as example templates; *.local.yaml is where each developer
# stores their populated dev seed (LLM models, MCP endpoints, etc).
# Also covers main's CAIPE_APP_CONFIG_FILE / CAIPE_SLACK_BOT_CONFIG_FILE overrides.
app-config.local.yaml
config/*.local.yaml
config/*.local.yml

